  npcName: Ms. Karen
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 2897825033842209335, guid: 57aea227e5ac6ec468936455fe01614e, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Hey there! I just wanted to stop by and say...
  - Well, I feel a little silly. I've been watching your house for weeks, thinking you were up to something weird.
  - Anyway, I made you a casserole! To apologize for being so nosy.
  - If you ever want to come over for tea my door is always open.
